    "body": "Nice find! It was me who introduced this bug. I suggest you to initialise temporary buffer with ampersand in the beginning of the state, remove initialisation from branch for named character references, append '#' in branch for numeric character references and just flush characters consumed in character reference in \"Anything else\" branch. In that case we can reuse already existing mechanism and avoid verbose explanation in \"Anything else\" branch.",
